#
# Configuration for ./swarm. Copy to swarm.env and edit. swarm.env is gitignored.
# Only paths to secrets go here, never the secrets themselves.

# ── Inference ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Any OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Every bot shares it; the sandbox policy allows
# egress to exactly this host and nothing else by default.
INFERENCE_BASE_URL=https://inference-api.nvidia.com/v1
INFERENCE_MODEL=nvidia/nvidia/nemotron-3-super-v3
# File holding the bearer token, mode 600, owned by you. Never copied into the
# repository or into a sandbox filesystem the bot can read back to you.
INFERENCE_KEY_FILE=$HOME/.secrets/inference.key
INFERENCE_CONTEXT_LENGTH=131072
INFERENCE_MAX_TOKENS=8192
# One bot on a different model, same endpoint and key. Name upper-cased, dashes
# to underscores. Set the matching VISION line when that model accepts images;
# without it Hermes strips image parts before the model sees them.
#INFERENCE_MODEL_NEMOCLAW_VISION=nvidia/nvidia/nemotron-3-nano-omni-30b-a3b-reasoning
#INFERENCE_VISION_NEMOCLAW_VISION=on

# ── Video (optional; see examples/README.md) ─────────────────────────────────
# Where NVIDIA RT-VLM answers, as the sandbox sees it. Only a bot whose policy
# names this host:port can reach it (examples/policies/nemoclaw-vss.yaml).
#VSS_BASE_URL=http://host.openshell.internal:8018
# Leave empty to use whatever single model RT-VLM advertises at /v1/models.
#VSS_MODEL=
# Clips copied into the vss bot's /sandbox/videos at creation.
#VSS_VIDEOS_DIR=examples/videos

# ── Hermes ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Git tag baked into the sandbox image. Keep every bot on one release.
HERMES_REF=v2026.8.31

# ── Fleet ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Space-separated bot names. Each needs souls/<name>.md. `swarm up` creates
# these; `swarm add` creates more. The name is the @handle in Hermes Desktop,
# the host profile, and (with an empty prefix) the sandbox.
BOTS="nemoclaw-researcher nemoclaw-reviewer"
# Optional sandbox name prefix. Empty means sandbox name == bot name.
SANDBOX_PREFIX=
# First api_server port; bots take consecutive free ports from here.
API_PORT_BASE=8477
# OpenShell docker bridge. Sandboxes reach it as host.openshell.internal.
BRIDGE_IP=172.18.0.1
SANDBOX_MEMORY=8Gi
SANDBOX_CPU=4

# ── Tracing (NeMo Relay -> OpenTelemetry collector) ──────────────────────────
TRACING=on
OTLP_PORT=4319
# Optional. When this file exists the collector also exports to LangSmith.
LANGSMITH_KEY_FILE=$HOME/.secrets/langsmith.key
LANGSMITH_PROJECT=hermes-swarm
LANGSMITH_ENDPOINT=https://api.smith.langchain.com/otel

# ── Paths ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Per-bot API keys, policies, and logs. Created with mode 700.
SWARM_STATE=$HOME/.swarm
